Subject: [PATCH] Preserve imported MCP endpoint identity

The API exposes the endpoint URL after import even though sealed external
configuration is absent from Terraform state. Use that readable endpoint to
avoid replacing the same server when the original HCL is restored.

diff --git a/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go b/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
--- a/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
+++ b/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
@@ -464,7 +464,7 @@ func (r *MCPServerResource) Schema(ctx context.Context, req resource.SchemaRequ
 					"url": schema.StringAttribute{
 						Optional: true,
 						PlanModifiers: []planmodifier.String{
-							stringplanmodifier.RequiresReplaceIfConfigured(),
+							mcpServerURLRequiresReplace(),
 						},
 						Description: `The HTTP endpoint URL of the external MCP server (HTTPS required). Requires replacement if changed.`,
 					},
